title: With the minimap switched off in the preferences, the canvas starts with none beside the selected file
folders: git-changes
prefs: {"minimap": false}
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3500
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1500
mark no-minimap
wait 450
left settings:minimap
wait 1200
mark setting-is-off
wait 450
quit
